    "name": "Inventory API",
    "description": "Inventory API - Group -> Item -> Movement.\n\nPick an environment first: Local (:3000), Test (:3100) or Production (:3200).\n\nThe folders run in order and each one leaves behind the ids the next one uses, so \"Run collection\" exercises the whole API end to end and every test should pass.\n\nFolder 5 sends requests that are meant to fail - that is where the business rules become visible.",
